(a) Generate an ensemble of 50 sample realizations of this Wiener process and arrange them into a \(50 \times 11\) matrix, where each row represents a realization.  
(b) Plot any 8 of these realizations and comment on the nonstationary character of the process.  
(c) Compute the average squares of the 50 realizations and plot the result versus time. Explain why the plot should be approximately linear with a slope of unity.
</USER_REQUEST>

